class=3D"content-visibility-auto"><h2>Az E=E2=82=88 adjung=C3=A1lt reprezen=
t=C3=A1ci=C3=B3ja</h2></div><div class=3D"content-visibility-auto"><p>Az E=
=E2=82=88 Lie-csoport egyed=C3=BCl=C3=A1ll=C3=B3 abban, hogy <strong>az adj=
ung=C3=A1lt reprezent=C3=A1ci=C3=B3ja a legkisebb nem-trivi=C3=A1lis reprez=
