dy><tr><td><strong>Dimenzi=C3=B3</strong></td><td>248</td></tr><tr><td><str=
ong>T=C3=A9r</strong></td><td>Maga az e=E2=82=88 Lie-algebra</td></tr><tr><=
td><strong>Lek=C3=A9pez=C3=A9s</strong></td><td><code>ad=E2=82=93(y) =3D [x=
, y]</code> (Lie-z=C3=A1r=C3=B3jel)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>A lek=C3=A9pez=C3=A9s matematikailag =C3=ADgy n=C3=A9z ki:</p>
<p><span class=3D"katex"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"=
><semantics><mrow><mtext>ad</mtext><mo>:</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=3D"frakt=
ur">e</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>=E2=86=92</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=3D"frakt=
ur">g</mi><mi mathvariant=3D"fraktur">l</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=3D"false">(=
</mo><mn>248</mn><mo stretchy=3D"false">)</mo><mo separator=3D"true">,</mo>=
<mspace width=3D"1em"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>=E2=86=A6</mo><msub><mtext>ad<=
/mtext><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=3D"application/x-tex">\=
text{ad}: \mathfrak{e}_8 \rightarrow \mathfrak{gl}(248), \quad x \mapsto \t=
ext{ad}_x</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>
<p>ahol minden <span class=3D"katex"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/=
Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=E2=88=88</mo><msub><mi mathvar=
iant=3D"fraktur">e</mi><mn>8</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=3D"appl=
ication/x-tex">x \in \mathfrak{e}_8</annotation></semantics></math></span> =
elem egy line=C3=A1ris oper=C3=A1tornak felel meg, amely m=C3=A1shogy hat a=
 248 dimenzi=C3=B3s vektort=C3=A9ren (amely maga az <span class=3D"katex"><=
math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><m=
i mathvariant=3D"fraktur">e</mi><mn>8</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encodin=
g=3D"application/x-tex">\mathfrak{e}_8</annotation></semantics></math></spa=
n> algebra).</p>
<h2>Invari=C3=A1ns alakok</h2>
<p>Az adjung=C3=A1lt reprezent=C3=A1ci=C3=B3hoz tartoz=C3=B3 invari=C3=A1ns=
 szimmetrikus biline=C3=A1ris forma a <strong>Killing-forma</strong>:</p>
<p><span class=3D"katex"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"=
><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=3D"false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo sepa=
rator=3D"true">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=3D"false">)</mo><mo>=3D</mo><mt=
ext>Tr</mtext><mo stretchy=3D"false">(</mo><msub><mtext>ad</mtext><mi>x</mi=
></msub><mo>=E2=88=98</mo><msub><mtext>ad</mtext><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stret=
chy=3D"false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=3D"application/x-tex">B(x, =
y) =3D \text{Tr}(\text{ad}_x \circ \text{ad}_y)</annotation></semantics></m=
ath></span></p>
<p>Ez egy fontos tulajdons=C3=A1ga annak, hogy az E=E2=82=88 egyszer=C5=B1 =
Lie-algebra.</p>
<h2>Felboml=C3=A1s maxim=C3=A1lis alt=C3=B6rzscsoportok alatt</h2>
<p>Az adjung=C3=A1lt 248-as reprezent=C3=A1ci=C3=B3 felbomlik kisebb r=C3=
=A9szekre, ha az E=E2=82=88-at nagyobb szimmetriacsoportokra korl=C3=A1tozz=
uk:</p>
<div class=3D"markdown-table-wrapper"><table node=3D"[object Object]"><thea=
d><tr><th>Alt=C3=B6rzs-csoport</th><th>Felboml=C3=A1s</th></tr></thead><tbo=
dy><tr><td><strong>E=E2=82=86 =C3=97 SU(3)</strong></td><td>(78, 1) =E2=8A=
=95 (1, 8) =E2=8A=95 (27, 3) =E2=8A=95 (27=CC=84, 3=CC=84)</td></tr><tr><td=
><strong>E=E2=82=87 =C3=97 SU(2)</strong></td><td>(133, 1) =E2=8A=95 (1, 3)=
 =E2=8A=95 (56, 2)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>Ezek a sz=C3=A1mok a k=C3=B6vetkez=C5=91ket jelentik:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>(78, 1)</strong>: az E=E2=82=86 adjung=C3=A1ltja (78 dimenzi=C3=
=B3) =C3=97 SU(3) trivi=C3=A1lis reprezent=C3=A1ci=C3=B3</li>
<li><strong>(27, 3)</strong>: az E=E2=82=86 alapvet=C5=91 reprezent=C3=A1ci=
=C3=B3ja (27) =C3=97 SU(3) alapvet=C5=91 reprezent=C3=A1ci=C3=B3 (3)</li>
</ul>
<h2>Fizikai jelent=C5=91s=C3=A9g</h2>
<p>A heterotikus h=C3=BArelm=C3=A9letben ez a felboml=C3=A1s nagyon fontos:=
</p>
<ul>
<li>Az <strong>E=E2=82=88 =C3=97 E=E2=82=88</strong> m=C3=A9rt=C3=A9kcsopor=
b=C3=B3l az egyik E=E2=82=88 lehet a spacetime szimmetria, m=C3=ADg a m=C3=
=A1sik a bels=C5=91 m=C3=A9rt=C3=A9k szimmetria</li>
<li>A r=C3=A9szecsk=C3=A9k a reprezent=C3=A1ci=C3=B3k s=C3=BAlyvektoraihoz =
(weight vectors) kapcsol=C3=B3dnak</li>
<li>Az adjung=C3=A1lt 248 dimenzi=C3=B3ja megfelelne 248 k=C3=BCl=C3=B6nb=
=C3=B6z=C5=91 r=C3=A9szecske-t=C3=ADpussnak, ha teljes szimmetriak realiz=
=C3=A1l=C3=B3dn=C3=A1nk</li>
</ul>
<p>Egyedi tulajdons=C3=A1g, hogy az E=E2=82=88 az egyetlen egyszer=C5=B1 Li=
e-csoport, amelynek nincs kisebb nem-trivi=C3=A1lis reprezent=C3=A1ci=C3=B3=
ja =E2=80=93 minden m=C3=A1s egyszer=C5=B1 csoportnak (G=E2=82=82, F=E2=82=
=84, E=E2=82=86, E=E2=82=87) van kisebb dimenzi=C3=B3s reprezent=C3=A1ci=C3=
=B3ja is.</p>
<p>Van konkr=C3=A9t algebrai strukt=C3=BAra, amire gondolsz? P=C3=A9ld=C3=
=A1ul a Kac-Moody kiterjeszt=C3=A9sek reprezent=C3=A1ci=C3=B3-elm=C3=A9lete=
