onti" E=E2=82=88 m=C3=A9rt=C3=A9kcsoporthoz vezet. <strong>H=C3=A1rom E=E2=
=82=88</strong>requires egy m=C3=A1sik topol=C3=B3gi=C3=A1t =E2=80=94 p=C3=
=A9ld=C3=A1ul egy <strong>h=C3=A1romr=C3=A9teg=C5=B1</strong> br=C3=A1n-str=
